  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helping Young People Rise Out of Refugee Camps</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boy With a Ball&apos;s Love Your City efforts send skilled, passionate teams out into slums and refugee camps to build relationships with the young people and their family members living there.  As trust and relationship form, these teams learn from the families and youth what obstacles they are currently facing to reach their dreams.  Team members then launch mentoring relationships and developmental small groups (job skills training, tutoring centers, language classes and more) to help them rise.</narrative>
  </description>
